[25.791739, "o", "=================== invoice_acct_001.pdf ===================\r\n"]
[25.793015, "o", "Page 1:\r\n"]
[25.822135, "o", "Northwind Analytics — Q1 2026 Invoice\r\nAccount ID: acct_001 | Billing Period: January – March 2026\r\nCurrency: USD\r\nsource_file | account_id | month | line_description | quantity | unit_price | amount_usd | line_type\r\ninvoice_acct_001.pdf | acct_001 | 2026-01 | Monthly Subscription | 1 | 500.0000 | 500.00 | base_plan\r\ninvoice_acct_001.pdf | acct_001 | 2026-01 | API Overage Calls | 0 | 0.0020 | 0.00 | overage\r\ninvoice_acct_001.pdf | acct_001 | 2026-02 | Monthly Subscription | 1 | 500.0000 | 500.00 | base_plan\r\ninvoice_acct_001.pdf | acct_001 | 2026-02 | API Overage (46,000 calls) | 46000 | 0.0020 | 92.00 | overage\r\ninvoice_acct_001.pdf | acct_001 | 2026-03 | Monthly Subscription | 1 | 500.0000 | 500.00 | base_plan\r\ninvoice_acct_001.pdf | acct_001 | 2026-03 | API Overage Calls | 0 | 0.0020 | 0.00 | overage\r\nInvoice Total: USD 1,592.00\r\n"]
[25.822374, "o", "=================== invoice_acct_002.pdf ===================\r\n"]
[25.823064, "o", "Page 1:\r\n"]
[25.842835, "o", "Alpine Cloud Systems — Q1 2026 Statement of Charges\r\nAccount ID: acct_002\r\nBilling Period: January 2026 – March 2026 | Currency: EUR\r\nJanuary 2026\r\nBase Plan Subscription ................................ EUR 500.00\r\nAPI Overage 75,000 calls .............................. EUR 150.00\r\nJanuary Subtotal: EUR 650.00\r\nFebruary 2026\r\nBase Plan Subscription ................................ EUR 500.00\r\nNo API overage charges this month.\r\nMarch 2026\r\nBase Plan Subscription ................................ EUR 500.00\r\nAPI Overage 250,000 calls ............................. EUR 425.00\r\nMarch Subtotal: EUR 925.00\r\nGrand Total: EUR 2,075.00\r\nPayment terms: Net 30 from invoice date.\r\n"]
[25.843058, "o", "=================== invoice_acct_003.pdf ===================\r\n"]
[25.843951, "o", "Page 1:\r\n"]
[25.855967, "o", "PixelWorks Studio — Quarterly Invoice Q1 2026\r\nAccount ID: acct_003 | Period: Jan–Mar 2026 | Currency: USD\r\nMonthly Charges:\r\nJan 2026: Base $500.00 | No API overage charges.\r\nFeb 2026: Base $500.00 | API Overage: 32,000 calls at $0.002/call = $64.00 (incl. tax $10.24) | Line total $74.24\r\nMar 2026: Base $500.00 | API Overage: 120,000 calls at $0.002/call = $240.00\r\nGrand Total: USD 2,314.24\r\nNote: Tax charges on usage lines subject to customer dispute (see ticket TKT-002).\r\n"]
[25.885551, "o", "\u001b[?2004hroot@03f8f4797f18:~# "]
[44.50125, "i", "cat << 'EOF' > inspect_details.py\nimport pdfplumber\n\nwith pdfplumber.open('/root/data/invoices/invoice_acct_001.pdf') as pdf:\n    print(\"--- acct_001 tables ---\")\n    for p in pdf.pages:\n        print(p.extract_tables())\n\nwith pdfplumber.open('/root/data/invoices/invoice_acct_002.pdf') as pdf:\n    print(\"--- acct_002 tables ---\")\n    for p in pdf.pages:\n        print(p.extract_tables())\n\nwith pdfplumber.open('/root/data/invoices/invoice_acct_003.pdf') as pdf:\n    print(\"--- acct_003 tables ---\")\n    for p in pdf.pages:\n        print(p.extract_tables())\nEOF\npython3 inspect_details.py\n"]
